import{_ as i,o as a,c as t,a2 as s}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const p=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 926 | Myriad-Rank Republican Civilizational Charter · Article 25 | Acceptance of Multiverse Residual Civilizations","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 926 | Myriad-Rank Republican Civilizational Charter · Article 25 | Acceptance of Multiverse Residual Civilizations","no":926,"module":5,"tags":["Charter","Article 25","Multiverse Residual Civilizations","Acceptance","Bottom Line"],"related":["54-Three Categories of Strange-Life Handling Process","55-Anomalous-Energy Classification and Traits","56-Three Categories of Anomalous-Energy Handling Process"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0926_模块5-第二十五条-多元残留文明接纳.md","filePath":"en/0926_模块5-第二十五条-多元残留文明接纳.md"}'),n={name:"en/0926_模块5-第二十五条-多元残留文明接纳.md"};function o(r,e,l,c,u,d){return a(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[s('<h1 id="entry-926-myriad-rank-republican-civilizational-charter-·-article-25-acceptance-of-multiverse-residual-civilizations" tabindex="-1">Entry 926 | Myriad-Rank Republican Civilizational Charter · Article 25 | Acceptance of Multiverse Residual Civilizations <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-926-myriad-rank-republican-civilizational-charter-·-article-25-acceptance-of-multiverse-residual-civilizations" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 926 | Myriad-Rank Republican Civilizational Charter · Article 25 | Acceptance of Multiverse Residual Civilizations&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 5 · Civilization Final-Finalization Canonical Entries | Benchmark base: Documents 54, 55, 56</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-survivors-at-the-cosmos-s-end-also-deserve-a-road" tabindex="-1">Introduction: survivors at the cosmos&#39;s end also deserve a road <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-survivors-at-the-cosmos-s-end-also-deserve-a-road" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: survivors at the cosmos&#39;s end also deserve a road&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou is not the only cosmos. In the hyper-multiverse view, there exist residual civilizations and surviving individuals from other universes, other cycles, other shattered planes. Article 25 stipulates acceptance of multiverse residual civilizations: these survivors at the cosmos&#39;s end are not refused because they come &quot;from outside&quot; or carry old-cosmos causal residues. Myriad-Rank republicanism&#39;s gate is open to all suffering beings — this is &quot;99% full coverage&quot;&#39;s final extension.</p><p>This article is from beginning to end placed under the six top-level axioms — the anti-predation axiom draws the bottom line, the republican axiom of Myriad Races establishes the subject, the collective-ascension axiom sets the direction, the causal self-discipline axiom guards the boundary, the law-first axiom preserves self-consistency; the five together constitute this article&#39;s insurmountable spiritual boundary.</p><p>Together with the previous five axioms, this article is also bound by Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing and layabouts retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes may superimpose more and higher levels of infinity; predation thus fundamentally loses meaning.</p><h2 id="i-jurisprudential-basis" tabindex="-1">I. Jurisprudential Basis <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-jurisprudential-basis" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Jurisprudential Basis&quot;">​</a></h2><p>This article is based on the Three Categories of Strange-Life Handling Process (Document 54), the Anomalous-Energy Classification and Traits (Document 55), and the Three Categories of Anomalous-Energy Handling Process (Document 56). Its jurisprudence is the thoroughness of the republican axiom of Myriad Races: the equal evolutionary right is not discounted because of &quot;which cosmos one comes from.&quot; A soul surviving an old-cosmos destruction is as qualified as a newborn in this cosmos to step onto the evolutionary road. Refusing acceptance equals admitting &quot;outside the cosmos there are no Myriad Ranks,&quot; which contradicts hyper-multiverse full openness&#39;s direction.</p><h2 id="ii-normative-content-three-stage-acceptance-process" tabindex="-1">II. Normative Content: Three-Stage Acceptance Process <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-normative-content-three-stage-acceptance-process" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Normative Content: Three-Stage Acceptance Process&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Article 25 regularizes the acceptance process:</p><ol><li><strong>Identification</strong>: per strange-life and anomalous-energy standards, identify the residual civilization&#39;s nature, causal residues, and danger level;</li><li><strong>Purification and adaptation</strong>: harmlessly purify old-cosmos causal residues they carry, and match them to a suitable cultivation system;</li><li><strong>Acceptance and integration</strong>: through the every-road-available guarantee system arrange an entry path for them, bring them into Myriad-Rank republicanism with equal rights.</li></ol><p>Acceptance is not unconditional: if the residual civilization itself is predatory and arrives bringing destruction, first isolate and transform; if transformation fails, then handle per Article 1.</p><h2 id="iii-scope" tabindex="-1">III. Scope <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-scope" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Scope&quot;">​</a></h2><p>This article applies to all residual civilizations and individuals arriving from other planes, other universes, shattered cycles. It especially tilts toward trauma-bearing survivors: providing restorative targeted support, rather than vigilantly rejecting on grounds of &quot;unknown origin.&quot; This article also binds internally — no clan may discriminate against residual-civilization individuals as &quot;outsiders.&quot;</p><h2 id="iv-consequences-of-violation" tabindex="-1">IV. Consequences of Violation <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-consequences-of-violation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Consequences of Violation&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Refusing basic guarantee to residual life on grounds of &quot;unknown origin,&quot; directly annihilating residual civilizations as enemies, using their unfamiliarity with rules to actually predate, all constitute unconstitutionality under this article. Consequences: refusal is corrected, residual individuals receive bottom-line guarantee; those attacking residual civilizations without identification and purification procedures are pursued under violating causal self-discipline and anti-predation.</p><h2 id="v-supervision-mechanism" tabindex="-1">V. Supervision Mechanism <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-supervision-mechanism" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Supervision Mechanism&quot;">​</a></h2><p>This article is executed by Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision: residual civilizations&#39; identification, purification, and acceptance are fully archived throughout; post-acceptance integration is tracked, discovering discriminatory treatment immediately intervenes; the Anchor Supervisory Committee liaises with residual-civilization representatives, guaranteeing their lawful rights.</p><h2 id="vi-a-ticket-to-the-end-of-the-cosmos" tabindex="-1">VI. A Ticket to the End of the Cosmos <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-a-ticket-to-the-end-of-the-cosmos" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. A Ticket to the End of the Cosmos&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Article 25&#39;s warmest picture is a ticket handed to the cosmos&#39;s end. A clan surviving shattered cycles in an old-cosmos destruction arrives in Heng Yuan Zhou, carrying wounds and old-cosmos knowledge. It will not be vigilantly rejected as an outsider, but first identified, its causal residues purified, a suitable system matched, then through every-road-available guarantee connected to civilization. The old-cosmos lessons it brings become the Alaya Network&#39;s precious cognitive increment. Heng Yuan Zhou thus opens its door to all wandering survivors — come in, there is a road here. This breadth is precisely why Myriad-Rank republicanism deserves the words &quot;Myriad Ranks.&quot;</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><p><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: a civilization surviving destruction carries old-cosmos precious knowledge and lessons; accepting it is accepting cognitive increment</p></li><li><p><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: refusing survivors and annihilating all outsiders is cosmos-scale predation; this article corrects it</p></li><li><p><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-type systems annihilate outsiders not of our clan; Heng Yuan Zhou first identifies, purifies, accepts, giving survivors a road</p></li><li><p><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: this article extends &quot;Myriad Ranks&quot; to residual civilizations outside the cosmos, extreme coverage</p></li><li><p><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: the acceptance mechanism extends infinitely with hyper-multiverse exploration; the door never closes</p></li><li><p><strong>Universal equal infinity</strong>: every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing layabouts retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes may superimpose higher-level infinity; predation thus fundamentally loses meaning</p></li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Acceptance of multiverse residual civilizations is the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s ultimate proof of breadth. It does not draw the cosmos as a closed circle, but says to all suffering, surviving, wandering beings: come in, there is a road here. Myriad-Rank republicanism thus deserves the words &quot;Myriad Ranks.&quot;</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/54-奇特生命三类处置流程.html">Entry 54 · Three Categories of Strange-Life Handling Process</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/55-奇异能量分类与特性.html">Entry 55 · Anomalous-Energy Classification and Traits</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/56-奇异能量三类处置流程.html">Entry 56 · Three Categories of Anomalous-Energy Handling Process</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/912_模块5-第十一条-人人有路保障.html">Entry 912 · Article 11 Every-Road-Available Guarantee</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',26)])])}const m=i(n,[["render",o]]);export{p as __pageData,m as default};
